        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-10-27T22:43:18.993Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Best advice I can offer is that it’s one of the hardest unlock conditions in the entire game, but it can be done. The fact that you’re having trouble just means you’re mortal like the rest of us. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=10\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> Don’t get frustrated, plug away at it from time to time, you’ll get it eventually.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
